with his wife, Janet Halyburton, Lady Dirletoun, who had excused herself earlier to attend to a matter in the gardens.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Ishabel MacDougall", "Janet Halyburton, Lady Dirletoun"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Ishabel MacDougall", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Janet Halyburton, Lady Dirletoun", "origin": "initial"}]}

